			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 402010201,
					"content": "Excuse me, passengers. Due to limited space in the cargo hold, we've been forced to store some of the goods on the deck. We apologize for the inconvenience.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Crewmember"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010202,
					"content": "Ah please, no need to apologize for your success in business! I just hope it rubs off on the rest of us! Hahaha...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Friendly Passenger"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010203,
					"content": "It looks like all the goods marked with Scamface's insignia have Corder listed as the shipper. Doddamani is in the cargo hold, likely making sure all the goods are in place for delivery.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010204,
					"content": "Are they... inspecting something? Why are they rifling through the boxes? Paimon can't make sense of it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010205,
					"content": "Here, take this cipher. It should help you figure out their coded messages.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010206,
					"content": "This is the plan — while I distract Corder and Doddamani, you two investigate the goods marked with Scamface's insignia. We might learn something useful.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010207,
						402010208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010207,
					"content": "If I find something concerning...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010209,
					"content": "By all means. I trust your judgement.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010210,
					"content": "Huh? W—W—Wait! You're just gonna go up and talk to those guys!? Yelan!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010211,
					"content": "Hm? Oh, excuse me gentlemen, but... Have we met?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010212,
					"content": "You're Mr. Corder, a famous antique collector in the Quartier Lyonnais, correct? I believe the three of us have had the pleasure of meeting once before. At Jiulue Teahouse in Yilong Wharf, if I'm not mistaken...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010213,
					"content": "Huh? You... You!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Doddamani"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010214,
					"content": "...Ah, the Dice Master of Yanshang Teahouse... It's a pleasure, Miss Yelan.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Corder"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010215,
					"content": "Oh, so you've heard of me too?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010216,
					"content": "Yes, I had an absolutely delectable cup of tea there once. One can hardly leave Yanshang Teahouse without hearing about your legendary dice skills. I suppose something keeps bringing us together. A shared love of tea, perhaps?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Corder"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010217,
					"content": "Yes, that must be it... Well, looks like we ran into each other at the perfect time. I'm heading to Fontaine on vacation, you see. Any recommendations on where I should visit?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010218,
					"content": "Someplace I could find an exquisite tea set, perhaps... Like a fine art exhibition. Or, an auction? I hear Fontainian black tea has a unique flavor. I imagine your tea sets are a sight to behold as well.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010219,
					"content": "You—!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Doddamani"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010220,
					"content": "Ah, does this gentleman have an interest in tea sets as well?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010221,
					"content": "I... Ahem... Of course. It's a pleasure to meet you, Miss Yelan. I'm also heading to Fontaine for travel. Corder's invitation, you see. In fact, I'm the one who owns this ship...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Doddamani"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010222,
					"content": "Yep, Yelan is actually talking to them! Are we sure that's a good idea...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010223,
						402010224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010223,
					"content": "We don't have much time!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010225,
					"content": "Alright! Then, let's go somewhere out of their line of sight so we can start investigating those boxes!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010226,
					"content": "*coughing* What's with the strong smell coming from these boxes? Must be a bunch of stuff mixed together...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010227,
					"content": "And there's a strange note. But, Paimon can't read what it says...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010228,
						402010229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010228,
					"content": "It's written in code...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010230,
					"content": "Yelan really thinks of everything, huh! But, uh... You know how to use this thing, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010231,
					"content": "Well? Well? What does it say?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010232,
						402010233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010232,
					"content": "If I'm right, they're planning to dispose of the goods...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010234
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010234,
					"content": "B—B—B—Blowing up the ship!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010235,
					"content": "Are they nuts? Paimon thought this was about getting the authorities off their tails... Not drawing even more attention!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010236,
						402010237,
						402010238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010236,
					"content": "Scamface needs to protect the person at the top...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010239
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010239,
					"content": "Okay, Yelan was right! This guy is a complete lunatic!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010240,
					"content": "There are innocent people on this ship! We need to find and disarm those bombs as soon as possible!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010237,
					"content": "So, he's diverting attention to an ever bigger problem...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010239
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010238,
					"content": "And cutting off all our leads in the process...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010239
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010233,
					"content": "...By blowing up the ship.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010234
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010229,
					"content": "Luckily, we have the cipher...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010224,
					"content": "She's giving us an opening! Let's use it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010208,
					"content": "Is it okay if I deal with it right then and there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010209
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
