			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 402010301,
					"content": "Oh, you scared the life out of Paimon, Yelan! Going right up to them like that... What if they caught on and decided to, you know... try something desperate!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010302,
					"content": "It's not a question of \"if,\" Paimon. I'm sure they caught on, but in the interest of their own survival, they had no choice but to play along.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010303,
					"content": "Now, we can be sure the Dark Financier is getting desperate. The stint on the ship, that was him trying to cut his losses to save his own skin.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010304,
					"content": "He needs to get rid of anything that could be traced back to him. So, you blow up the ship. You send the goods meant for the auction straight to the bottom of the sea, and let Scamface take the heat...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010305,
					"content": "The last thing he wanted was for the goods to make it to the auction. But, now, we've ensured that they will. So, he has no choice but to follow through.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010306,
					"content": "He could choose not to send one of his agents to the auction, and let his goods go to an unsuspecting buyer instead. But remember, their worth is inflated...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010307,
					"content": "It would only be a matter of time before the buyer realized the valuation was off and reported it to the authorities. As the seller, Corder would be staring down a potential conviction.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010308,
					"content": "At best, the Dark Financier has to find a new kind of Mora-laundering scheme. At worst, he loses one of his last reliable agents in Fontaine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010309,
						402010310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010309,
					"content": "And, if he does decide to continue with the auction...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010311,
					"content": "Exactly. Our trail of evidence remains intact, and we let the buyer at the auction lead us closer to the Dark Financier.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010312,
					"content": "Okay, um... So, uh... That means, um... Could we go over this again?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010313,
					"content": "#Don't worry. I'm sure {NICKNAME} will explain it again in Paimon-friendly language.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010314,
					"content": "We're in the home stretch, and taking advantage of this auction is crucial... So, come prepared to see this through.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010315,
					"content": "Officer Edler already has an informant stationed at the scene. This invitation letter will get you in to the auction.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010316,
					"content": "I'll meet you at the Hotel Debord in two days.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010310,
					"content": "That also works in our favor...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010311
					]
				}
			]
		},
