			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 402010401,
					"content": "Alright, that's all the bombs on the deck. What about the cargo hold? Do we have enough time?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010402,
					"content": "Already taken care of.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010403,
					"content": "Good work, you two. You stayed calm and acted fast. That was the perfect response to a situation like this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010404,
					"content": "Yelan! Honestly, it's all thanks to you. It was your idea to board the ship. And, we never would've been able to figure out that message without your cipher...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010405,
					"content": "Wait a sec... Where are Corder and Doddamani?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010406,
					"content": "Heh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010407,
					"content": "Recovering from the shock, I would imagine. Suddenly finding out that you're being targeted by a dangerous individual... That must have been quite the ordeal for you, gentlemen? Almost lost your cargo and your lives in one fell swoop...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010408,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Corder"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010409,
					"content": "Indeed. To think such evil exists in this world... I can scarcely imagine what I did to offend this fellow. Resorting to murder like this... It's quite unfathomable.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Corder"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010410,
					"content": "Well, no need to fear. I'll alert the Maison Gardiennage at once and ask them to send agents to Lumidouce Harbor. The two of you are clearly in need of protection.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010411,
					"content": "Your cargo will also need to be handed over to the authorities for inspection, Mr. Corder — just to eliminate any remaining hazards. After which, the Maison Gardiennage will escort it all to its intended destination, of course.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010412,
					"content": "So, if I may... Where are your goods heading, Mr. Corder?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010413,
					"content": "...To the Hotel Debord. For an auction in two days.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Corder"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010414,
					"content": "Ah, then rest assured. The Maison Gardiennage is full of diligent and responsible personnel. You can trust that your goods will arrive at the auction without a scratch.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010415,
					"content": "Our sincerest thanks.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Corder"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010416,
					"content": "After some time, the ship safely docks at Lumidouce Harbor. The Maison Gardiennage conduct a quick safety inspection and unload all the cargo from the ship.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010417
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010417,
					"content": "In the meantime, you tell Yelan about the note Scamface left for Corder and Doddamani.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
