			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 402010501,
					"content": "Okay, so no fakes. These people are definitely anxious to get their goods to Fontaine all in one go...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010502,
					"content": "But did you see the strange markings on some of them? Wonder what they mean... Let's go ask Yelan!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010503,
					"content": "You find Yelan and tell her the results of the investigation...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010504,
					"content": "Good work. As for the auction, Officer Edler was able to gather some useful intel too. We're almost certain their target is the auction taking place at the Hotel Debord in two days.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010505,
					"content": "The markings you managed to capture were applied with a special kind of paint. Almost impossible to notice without some kind of specialized tech, like the Forensic Imaging Device.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010506,
					"content": "I think we're looking at a Treasure Hoarder insignia. Each big shot in the organization has their own — almost like a personal signature. And considering what we know about the case, I'd wager this is Scamface's handiwork.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010507,
						402010508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010507,
					"content": "So... He's labeling the goods. But why?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010509,
					"content": "Based on the port manifest, it looks like the marked goods include... fertilizer from Sumeru, local fireworks, soap, and perfume.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010510,
					"content": "So nothing special then... Just some farming products and everyday necessities?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010511,
					"content": "Fertilizer, soap, and perfume... No, there's something going on there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010512,
					"content": "Might be risky, but I'm gonna investigate on board, and hitch a ride to Fontaine while I'm at it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010513,
						402010514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010513,
					"content": "We've made it this far...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010515
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010515,
					"content": "Yeah, let's see this thing through! Paimon's gotta know what's going on here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010516,
					"content": "Well, you've proved yourselves so far, so I don't see a problem with that. Just know, once we board the ship, we're bound to come face to face with Corder and Doddamani.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010517,
					"content": "So, make sure you're prepared. The investigation might look a little different this time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Yelan"
				},
				{
					"id": 402010514,
					"content": "We'll come with you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010515
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 402010508,
					"content": "What message is he trying to send?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402010509
					]
				}
			]
		},
